{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-e41c7a", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "毎日同じ二十五分を再生する情景から、毎日数え直される棚の対話へ。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-71219d", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-75683d", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-75683d", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "数を書いた覚え書きへ、数が動いたあとで応じる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-afd238", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-a29f5b", "type": "fragment"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-75683d", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "訂正の宛先と、手順を渡すことの区別を開いたまま置く。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-eea0fa", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-864d16", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-75683d", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "訂正に宛先が必要かという問いへ、欄の不在を数えて応じる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-7ac17c", "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-6955da", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-75683d", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "数えることと祈ることを分けたまま、数え直しの手順を足す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-b45eb9", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "Q-20261024-1db8e6", "type": "question"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-75683d", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "数を引くときは日付を一緒に引く、という運用の弱さを対話へ移す。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-6d74a5", "relation_type": "transforms", "right": {"id": "MAT-RES-20261024-71138a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "FRAG-20261024-75683d", "type": "fragment"}, "note": "位置を書き間違えた素材を、本文は消さずに脇へ判定を置く例として使う。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-4be018", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-0d26a4", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-0d26a4", "type": "material"}, "note": "位置の誤りを訂正できる素材と、解釈が分かれるまま残す素材を対照する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-31370d", "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-92cc41", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-158adf", "type": "material"}, "note": "定足数を要する祈りと、名前を読み上げる式。どちらも手続きが人数を要求する。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-2f8059", "relation_type": "echo", "right": {"id": "MAT-RES-20261024-71138a", "type": "material"}}
{"created_at": "2026-10-24", "left": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-e182c5", "type": "material"}, "note": "「いつまで」という反復と、理由を捨てた一回性を、決着させずに並べる。", "relation_id": "REL-20261024-5d0620", "relation_type": "leaves_open", "right": {"id": "MAT-LIT-20261024-0d26a4", "type": "material"}}
